{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415735","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415735","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041573501:1":{"text":"わっ！どうしよう、キミのコップが外に飛んでいっちゃった……まさか空境の森までいっちゃったりしないよね……","source_cn":"糟了，你的水杯，飞出屋外了！不会落到空境森林里了吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4C016BA44A07AE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041573502:1":{"text":"今、コップが自分で浮き上がったよね？","source_cn":"它是……自己飞起来的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97656E2BF3992CE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041573503:1":{"text":"えっと……そよ風術で、中のお茶を冷ましてあげようと思ったんだ。でも、ボクの魔法って、よく変異しちゃうから……本当に、ごめん……","source_cn":"我本来只是想用微风术把里面的热茶吹凉，但我的魔法总会突...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6949A750559D726","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041573504:1":{"text":"謝らないで。君ってすごいんだね！","source_cn":"不会，你真厉害。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB104C11091C7EFDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041573505:1":{"text":"僕もキキを凧みたいに飛ばしたいんだけど……いつも途中で落ちちゃうんだ。","source_cn":"我也试过让奇奇飞起来，像风筝那样……可惜飞不了太远。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6BD57068F8F412B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041573506:1":{"text":"……キキ？ボクもげっ歯類のお友だちからピピって呼ばれてるんだけど、そのキキもげっ歯類なの？","source_cn":"……奇奇？唔，我的啮齿类朋友们会叫我皮皮，难道奇奇也是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD064017D4D952230","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041573507:1":{"text":"キキは僕のぬいぐるみだよ。","source_cn":"奇奇是我的玩偶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F4E476A759B56FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041573508:1":{"text":"ママがくれた、いちばんのお友だちなんだ。","source_cn":"它是妈妈送给我的，是我最好的朋友。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE909FCA6667BC728","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041573509:1":{"text":"えっと、よく分からないんだけど、ぬいぐるみと言えばね……","source_cn":"呃，虽然没有很明白，但你要是不嫌我麻烦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE31604B936E059F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041573510:1":{"text":"こ、この前、商店街のぬいぐるみの鼻を、全部、虹色に変えちゃったんだ……","source_cn":"就、就比如前几天，我不小心把商业街上所有的玩偶鼻子都变...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F191A326C1EB94C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041573511:1":{"text":"お店の人は、着色の手間が省けたって言ってくれたけど……","source_cn":"虽然老板夸我为他们节省了上色的时间……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6B9871FC407D8E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041573512:1":{"text":"わあ！すっごく楽しそう！キキが喋れたら、きっと素敵だって言うと思うよ！","source_cn":"哇！听起来真有趣，要是奇奇会说话，它一定会喜欢彩色的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19C826BC0CB374E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041573513:1":{"text":"えへへ、ボク、キミとお友だちになりたいな！","source_cn":"那我们可以成为好朋友！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x411BBA88F2352B05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041573514:1":{"text":"お友だち……ほんとう？僕はダイモン、君は？ピピっていうの？","source_cn":"朋友……真的吗？我叫戴蒙，你呢，你叫皮皮吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6E8083E11266947","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041573515:1":{"text":"ボクはピッパー。ピピって呼んでもいいよ。これからよろしくね、ダイモン！","source_cn":"我叫皮帕，叫我皮皮也行，很高兴认识你，戴蒙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x381C221261D054AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041573516:1":{"text":"明日もここに来る？よかったら一緒に舟で釣りに行かない？","source_cn":"明天你还会再来这里吗？我想和你一起去划船、钓鱼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB646DBA7AE16F142","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041573517:1":{"text":"君の魔法なら、釣り竿を使わなくても、お魚が自分から飛び出してくるかも！","source_cn":"皮皮的魔法那么厉害，说不定用不着出钩，湖里的鱼就都自己...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50AD21952AF16004","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041573518:1":{"text":"えっ……お魚……舟……飛び出す……うぅ、い、嫌な記憶が……","source_cn":"啊……鱼……船……飞起来……我想起一些不好的回忆……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD510D4B709D6862B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041573519:1":{"text":"う、ううん、ダイモンが行きたいって言うなら……うん！一緒に釣りに行こう！","source_cn":"诶，不管了，戴蒙喜欢，我们就去钓鱼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0C16BA9E2369607","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041573520:1":{"text":"明日、ソリス先生や他の人たちも誘うよ。皆も、きっとキミを好きになってくれると思うから！","source_cn":"明天，我叫上娑丽丝老师，还有好多好多人一起来，他们一定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x824722D3A638667C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:皮帕":{"text":"ピッパー","source":"皮帕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:戴蒙":{"text":"ダイモン","source":"戴蒙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row